abstract: >-
  AetherOS is a Rust-first x86_64 bare-metal AI operating system / unikernel
  exploring direct Intel Gen9 GPGPU and AVX2 multi-core transformer inference,
  deterministic execution, hardware-level observability, and evidence-backed
  optimization on physical Intel Comet Lake hardware.
